{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\hist\\037.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Unit:02TheAncientCivilizations", "conf": 0.922, "box": [[500, 107], [771, 103], [771, 126], [500, 129]]}, {"text": "Mysterious End of Indus Valley Civilization", "conf": 0.867, "box": [[94, 154], [770, 155], [770, 191], [94, 190]]}, {"text": "into decay. What happened? Some historians believe that this Civilization was destroyed", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[93, 266], [1151, 252], [1152, 291], [94, 305]]}, {"text": "by a natural disaster, such as a major drought or flood, or because the Indus Basin dried", "conf": 0.951, "box": [[96, 300], [1152, 287], [1153, 323], [97, 337]]}, {"text": "up due to a change in river routes.This caused shortening of rainy season resulting in the", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[97, 338], [1151, 324], [1152, 353], [98, 366]]}, {"text": "destruction of forests and crops. Archaeologists have discovered a half-dozen groups of", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[98, 368], [1153, 358], [1154, 388], [99, 398]]}, {"text": "skeletons in the ruins of Mohenjo-Daro which were probably neverburied.Their presence", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[97, 401], [1154, 392], [1155, 422], [98, 431]]}, {"text": "suggests that the city was abandoned following a natural disaster or a devastating attack", "conf": 0.92, "box": [[95, 434], [1155, 425], [1156, 458], [96, 467]]}, {"text": "byhuman enemies.", "conf": 0.823, "box": [[100, 471], [352, 471], [352, 498], [100, 498]]}, {"text": "Around this time, the Aryans, nomadic people from Central Asia, swept into the Indus", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[94, 515], [1152, 512], [1152, 547], [94, 551]]}, {"text": "Valley. It is unknown whether Aryans caused the collapse of the Indus Valley civilization or", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[94, 548], [1151, 546], [1151, 583], [94, 584]]}, {"text": "followed in its wake. Because no weapons were found during the excavations, historians", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[95, 583], [1147, 584], [1147, 617], [95, 616]]}, {"text": "battles.", "conf": 0.